{"4438370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gym Rat Simulator", "steam_appid": 4438370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamers, you know the drill. A small local gym needs your help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gym Rat Simulator, your goal is to turn this scrappy gym into a 5-star fitness hotspot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the Gym with new equipment </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order a growing variety of gym machines from the catalogue. Place and rearrange them to create your desired layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract new Gym members with quality merchandise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the prices, and serve members at the cashier to keep the revenue flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Staff to maintain the Gym</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring in workers to clean and repair gym machines for you. Hire personal coaches to boost member satisfaction. Host fitness classes with trainers to generate extra income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your own character to prepare for fitness contest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into workout mini-games to determine how effective each training session is. Grow different muscle group to prepare for competitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fitness contest and Gym Promotion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more features by winning in different fitness contest and grow your gym's reputation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamers, you know the drill. A small local gym 